            <div xml:id="m-08a00faa-879f-4ab1-8bcc-c1cb9499c802">
              <lg xml:id="m-e5fdef53-465f-486e-bab9-35fb600b308c">
                <l xml:id="m-25a5698c-4b9d-4778-86bf-00cd1ad9a3b2" facs="#m-1e765fe5-c69a-4aba-a8ca-62b0e8ea4543" label="ambiguous">1238</l><l xml:id="m-4e776e94-d7d9-4ff0-a883-fe05896f7ed5" facs="#m-73d9b8f6-5ded-42c5-a212-baecba589843" label="text-like">Common of a Holy Woman Martyr. Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-32bbf441-4122-440e-9657-3a642879fb55" facs="#m-6dd841ad-018b-424c-97b5-51381303be96" label="lyrics-like">stí¬</l><l xml:id="m-a1199f87-e40b-4a03-9bce-2b43d14d0165" facs="#m-3c962eb5-fbdf-4c99-9938-b2abdc29da9b" label="lyrics-like">ti- am: et de-dú¬</l><l xml:id="m-2786ec5e-8640-406b-b5d4-58a7d3268610" facs="#m-712d2cc4-396b-4640-a101-454a9ca62070" label="ambiguous">cet te</l><l xml:id="m-29dca7f2-3af2-4c80-99f5-2f032bd99b34" facs="#m-84efe735-8e83-40b8-9846-602a5b06a13a" label="lyrics-like">mi- rabí¬ li-ter</l><l xml:id="m-5e6c76f8-42eb-40f3-ad7e-16a01e297062" facs="#m-8d857a74-4361-4750-9cc2-7564005f5852" label="lyrics-like">*déx-tera tú¬ a.</l><l xml:id="m-2cb81b5f-d89b-4a99-997b-90b09d929895" facs="#m-7a91062e-848c-448e-9606-a5dbca98d5e5" label="ambiguous">Gospel. Simile est. p. 1223.</l><l xml:id="m-0ae93601-68ce-45c3-9074-fed9a88c627c" facs="#m-8a29ab7b-d484-4f7a-bd8c-8e51c5ede98f" label="lyrics-like">offertory. Diffúsa est. p. 1223.</l><l xml:id="m-8752c1c8-6591-4382-97ab-c29f4cd75137" facs="#m-57c9e645-ab17-4eaf-9663-1cbf94eb6093" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-aea7b2c5-ff48-45d7-bff7-bb490013b271" facs="#m-daa8f507-163f-495f-92a5-3ea255008f9b" label="lyrics-like">TUscipe Dómine, múnera, quae confidimus patrocinio liberári. Per</l><l xml:id="m-05e200a1-d438-4b60-98ef-7a6a790c9272" facs="#m-78f385bb-3aaa-4b46-8c28-2b093297bf0c" label="lyrics-like">D in beátae N. Mártyris tuae</l><l xml:id="m-4cd0182f-7352-4cca-becc-8f584aec67f3" facs="#m-2b26e2b1-cf19-49e8-a0ef-98ea474baa32" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-1577bc2e-b5b1-4a50-a2fe-910346ae8470" facs="#m-83fd39da-a8ec-41af-ab2a-dc6d9220ed1a" label="lyrics-like">solemnitáte deférimus: cujus nos</l><l xml:id="m-9f99fd5b-0ae6-41d6-917e-e79108afa4e9" facs="#m-dab99823-59a9-41db-acd1-47b575eb9dbb" label="text-like">For two or more Holy Women Martyrs. Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-27655500-361c-4c45-a946-7fd8146f8be6" facs="#m-75d0b288-a859-4f71-a385-f179bad0de82" label="lyrics-like">TNténde, quaésumus Dómine, mú-haec beáta mystéria illis glóriam</l><l xml:id="m-225314de-6189-45c7-829f-408ea689da70" facs="#m-f390f1a7-cb58-4765-884d-fcd06a7b4c93" label="lyrics-like">L nera altáribus tuis pro sanctá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b23c5aa6-3db1-4f54-ae32-9079a19cf28d" facs="#m-87925e98-cced-4a2a-b459-5783db720b06" label="lyrics-like">contulisti; ita nobis indulgéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-8820c576-cab2-43a0-a872-41017c84fad7" facs="#m-91032949-9b39-40da-815a-530f955cc8fb" label="lyrics-like">rum Mártyrum tuárum N. et N.] largiáris. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9928e2f9-be25-4f62-b362-f61353621e1a" facs="#m-6551de84-eec5-44bf-88a8-e9fb12b7726f" label="lyrics-like">festivitáte propósita: ut, sicut per</l><l xml:id="m-87de3ad3-6126-4c0d-b731-22e8caa6e711" facs="#m-2bfe6646-2798-44b8-a6a9-28d53bfe19b5" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-b8a7987c-409c-47dc-9440-690a1cb5dbfb" facs="#m-8ac066f4-807d-4098-9828-d2769d70259e" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-7f6943c6-6d62-4799-b516-6be8471626b9" facs="#m-9ac7f7b0-a9c5-4aeb-afb4-c9b03dbfd6ee" label="lyrics-like">Rínci-pes“ persecú-ti sunt me gra¬ tis, et a vér¬</l><l xml:id="m-00c6e746-4572-4cc6-827e-44117b5f79c5" facs="#m-b6be6f5e-8c51-4132-a606-54bd979a51d5" label="lyrics-like">bis tú- is formi-dá-vit cor mé¬ um: laetábor égo</l><l xml:id="m-b2e5f042-eb86-48be-bb35-5c8660d4239c" facs="#m-4dfb936c-03ca-46c0-b315-47687c94d048" label="lyrics-like">spó¬</l><l xml:id="m-26ddba47-eace-4cc1-874a-d17e7ec4179b" facs="#m-70282dab-e6f1-4f05-907d-9ee481d1d372" label="lyrics-like">su- per e-lóqui- a tú¬ a, quasi qui invé-nit</l><l xml:id="m-00127369-6de3-419b-b5a1-6a8577f9c4e1" facs="#m-367b1bd6-3986-4233-b24f-67ac4ce5dc03" label="lyrics-like">li-a múl- ta. T. P. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-453b9c15-9cba-44e6-ac3d-7671db84722f" facs="#m-dde1b383-d999-46da-aeef-991774f34102" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-c243c7c7-5eaa-41b2-aad9-a3e8ebe54c3b" facs="#m-af8a02b6-e060-4ea8-ac0f-5b876c5a59f8" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-f6dadc8a-3c69-49e2-a2fd-8235b0eb40a0" facs="#m-743ea91b-c842-450b-98b1-94e76fbb64da" label="lyrics-like">H Uxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sum- fáciant protectióne gaudére. Per</l><l xml:id="m-aec729d9-a9f2-43a6-a7e3-19fb7792ceb7" facs="#m-7004a6b3-edea-463f-a40b-7cb2bb34224c" label="lyrics-like">Al pta mystéria: et, intercedénte! Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-0729bf34-0d7d-44e5-8f40-0a9b2f1e3462" facs="#m-122eb17a-f0af-4288-9da7-d66cc0f2462f" label="lyrics-like">beáta N. Mártyre tua, sempitérna!</l><l xml:id="m-aa2d583b-6b21-4a16-b997-a78aba538279" facs="#m-b0bc5b1c-fc7f-439c-9f83-b88e030a8b89" label="text-like">For two or more Holy Women Martyrs. Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-a69a2832-cc60-4dc4-9504-a1b9b6cd03b7" facs="#m-96daa949-d2d7-4742-b8b3-f9c496baa66c" label="lyrics-like">Raesta nobis, quaésumus Dó-¡ore contíngimus, pura mente ca¬</l><l xml:id="m-c327a30f-d51a-46a8-a2ee-03fee5cf94f4" facs="#m-662c6d5d-e800-4ecf-a6e6-df60f4a8c8f3" label="lyrics-like">Emine, intercedéntibus sanctis! piámus. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-aee57750-812a-4efe-9027-1e3060ede851" facs="#m-4ba77747-4443-4b01-b745-4c8e46f4ad58" label="ambiguous">Martyribus tuis N. et N. :ut, quod</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
